0..77 Comment "// The holders of the roles of inductive-recursive definitions, with a family"
78..109 Comment "// whose decoder holds no role."
110..112 Comment "//"
113..191 Comment "// The canonical family\'s field names its decoder, the declaration right after"
192..265 Comment "// it. That decoder holds the decoder role, or the family is no canonical"
266..328 Comment "// family. A decoder that holds no role keeps the stage check."
329..331 Comment "//"
332..410 Comment "// The checker reads the declaration after the family. This one holds no role,"
411..485 Comment "// so the checker refuses the family. The decoder calls itself through the"
486..562 Comment "// decode of the arguments, at no stage below its value, and the stage order"
563..577 Comment "// refuses it."
578..580 Comment "//"
581..661 Comment "// - see: `model/universe/ir-codes.gandr` — the family a signature defines and"
662..688 Comment "//   its decoder, admitted"
